mapping "W1510.1" source="W1510" target="4521008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W1510 SNOMED CT 4521008 = Swedish subdivision of ICD-10 W15 (Fall from cliff), refined by
        place (residential institution) and activity (sport/exercise). Target SNOMED CT 432806
        (concept_code 4521008), standard concept (S), the Athena crosswalk target for the parent ICD-10
        W15. No standard SNOMED CT concept captures the place+activity axes (the [X]Fall from cliff,
        occurrence. concepts are deprecated U, valid_end 2009-01-31); 432806 is the nearest standard
        ancestor. Broader with two-level specificity loss (place and activity dropped), low confidence
        per rubric.
        """
}
